With these two changes:

- every new plane now has an `id` matching `shape.id + '_plane'`, so  
  `canvas.findRoot( getPlaneIdFromShape(shape) )` actually finds it  
- whenever the root changes (i.e. you deep-link or click the arrow), we re-run the drill-down overlay logic so that your + icon comes back into view immediately.
